2. Pre-existing fact conflict: the FRESH EYES block dates the DNA finding to January 2020, the body says November 2019. Outside cohesion scope; resolve before publish.
3. Still open from the second pass and unaffected by this one: `faqs` frontmatter absent, `same-type-similarity` not re-run, `/grade_blog` not yet run.
